menu "Korvo KWS experiment"
    config KORVO_KWS_VERBOSE_LOG
        bool "Verbose log: print every window and a status block every second"
        default n
        help
            Off (default, quiet log): a KWS line prints only for a one-second window whose
            rms reaches the speech gate (0.005) and for every event, plus a STATUS line
            about every 30 seconds. Faults are never hidden: GAP overflow, read errors,
            feature failures and skipped windows print as warnings or errors at once.
            On: every window prints a KWS line, and a blocks line with two slot lines
            prints about once a second.
endmenu
